Z||000001||p4n1c||02-23-2001||03:33 PM||||This is what myself and few people have been discussing, because the crash didn't look bad from a race point of view, I've seen guys saumersault in the air(drag) and flip down the track(nascar/formula) and still get out.  Dale Sr. just did a head on with the wall and was flew off into the grass.  <P>My response to them was that the seatbelt/harness either malfunctioned or something went really wrong with the car.<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)||||reg||1
